{"resourceIdentifier":"3433","resourceName":"Guiyang Afforestation Project","description":"Guiyang Afforestation Project (hereafter refer to as “the project”) is located at Guiyang City.\r\n10,158.2 ha (152,373 Mu ) of forest was planted on suitable land for afforestation in Guiyang City where used to be poorly sustainable in terms of ecological environment and suffer from karst rocky desertification. Prior to the project, the project area was suitable land for forest, there is no forestry management and the coverage by planting trees is low, and there has never been any activity affecting the local ecosystem . By checking the afforestation plan with the Guiyang Forestry Bureau, it was confirmed that a small number of trees have been planted in the project area before the afforestation project. However, the forest coverage rate is relatively low. Therefore, considering this situation, the Guiyang Forestry Bureau determined that the project area is suitable for afforestation after investigation, then the Forestry Bureau approved the supplementary planting without disturbing the existing trees to increase the vegetative cover. The forest farm and Guiyang Forestry Industry Development Co., Ltd implement the afforestation project, and Guiyang Forestry Industry Development Co., Ltd is authorized to apply for carbon sink projects on behalf of the forest farm, and to implement management activities such as monitoring.\r\nThe project is to plant without disturbing the existing trees, and only the trees actually planted in the project were monitored. The carbon credit of the original trees in the baseline scenario will not be monitored or counted in the actual net GHG removals by sinks.","location":{"latitude":26.550000,"longitude":106.783332},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-01-16","endExclusive":"2023-02-16","endInclusive":"2023-02-15"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3433"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guiyang Forestry Industry Development Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"81672"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"10158 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 12/04/2018 - 11/04/2048"}]}]},{"programCode":"CCB","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guiyang Forestry Industry Development Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Project withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"81672"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Afforestation, Reforestation and Revegetation"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"10158 Hectares"}]},{"code":"CCB_STANDARD_EDITION_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CCB Third Edition"}]},{"code":"FIRST_VERIFICATION_VER_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=70066&IDKEY=8097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09n